[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夏葉！　おめでとう！\r\n３次審査も突破したぞ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "013",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001050010,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ありがとう！　プロデューサーのおかげよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300105/7013001050010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そこまで喜ぶなんて、珍しいな\r\n『W.I.N.G.』参加まで審査はまだあるぞ",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001050020,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いいの、今は言いたいのよ！　言わせて頂戴！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300105/7013001050020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001050030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "プロデューサーはアイドルとして、私がどうあるべきか、\r\n方向を定め、ここまで育ててくれたんだもの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300105/7013001050030"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001050040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "感謝の気持ちでいっぱいよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300105/7013001050040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか。ありがとう\r\nこれからももっと夏葉の力になれるように頑張るよ",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それにしても、なんかもう夢が叶ったみたいな\r\n言い方だったな",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001050050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "うふふ、そうね\r\n浮かれるのはここまでにしましょうか",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300105/7013001050050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001050060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "さあ、次に向けて気持ちの切り替え……",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300105/7013001050060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001050070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "よし、できたわ！\r\nすぐにレッスンをしましょう",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300105/7013001050070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001050080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私が目指すのは世界一のアイドルだもの\r\nこんなところで満足なんてできないわ",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300105/7013001050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001050090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "もっともっと、頑張っていくわよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300105/7013001050090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\n１つ１つ努力を積み重ねていこう",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001050100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ！　私はこれからも\r\n私にできることを全力でやっていくの！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300105/7013001050100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001050110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "だから、プロデューサー\r\nこれからも私を支えて頂戴！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300105/7013001050110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、任せてくれ！\r\n夏葉ならこの先、何があっても歩みを止めないと信じてるぞ",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001050120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ありがとう！　今後もそう言ってもらえるよう、\r\n私も気を引き締めていくわ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300105/7013001050120"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001050130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "これからもトップアイドルへの道を\r\n真っ向から突き進んでいくんだから！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300105/7013001050130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああっ！　その意気だぞ、夏葉！\r\nこのまま思い切り突っ走っていこう！",
    "charLabel": "nathuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
